_A7 = [("Walong kolorum ang hinuli kahapon ng MMDA sa ilalim ng OPLAN disiplina.", "Eight colorum vehicles were caught yesterday by the MMDA under OPLAN Disiplina. (The book prints the number; the audio script for Activity 12 gives forty-eight.)"), ("Pursigido ang ilang senador na ituloy ang imbestigasyon hinggil sa sinasabing Padrino System sa loob ng Bureau of Customs.", "Some senators are determined to continue the investigation of the so-called Padrino System inside the Bureau of Customs."), ("Ang disiplina ay pakikisama at pagdamay dahil ito ang siyang huhubog ng ating kinabukasan.", "Discipline is companionship and sympathy because it is what will shape our future."), ("Kasabay ng walang tigil na paalala ng pamahalaan na sundin ang batas trapiko, isang lalaki ang nasawi matapos tumawid sa maling tawiran sa Roxas Boulevard.", "Along with the government’s non-stop reminder to follow the traffic law, a man died after crossing at the wrong crossing on Roxas Boulevard.")]
_A8 = [("Iminungkahi ng Demokratikong Sosyalistang Kabataan ng Pilipinas o DSKP sa Department of Education na muling gawing mandatory ang Reserve Officers Training Corp o ROTC sa high school upang maibalik ang disiplina, paggalang at pagiging makabayan ng mga kabataan.", "The Democratic Socialist Youth of the Philippines (DSKP) proposed to the Department of Education to make the Reserve Officers Training Corps (ROTC) mandatory again in high school in order to bring back the discipline, respect and patriotism of the youth."), ("Ayon sa DSKP, unti-unti nang nawawala ang disiplina ng kabataan partikular na sa mga estudyante na nagdudulot sa kanila ng kawalan ng respeto sa pamahalaan at sa bansa na nagbubunsod naman ng kanilang pagkilos laban sa gobyerno.", "According to the DSKP, the discipline of the youth is gradually disappearing, particularly among students, which causes them to lack respect for the government and the country, which in turn drives their action against the government."), ("Sinabi ni Michael Eric Castillo, head ng education and program committee ng DSKP, ang pambabastos kay Pangulong Arroyo noong nakaraang graduation rites sa Silang, Cavite at sa Philippine General Hospital noong nakaraang linggo ay palatandaan ng pagkakaroon ng mal-education ng mga estudyante na naimpluwensiyahan ng mga anti-democratic forces.", "Michael Eric Castillo, head of the education and program committee of the DSKP, said the disrespect toward President Arroyo at the recent graduation rites in Silang, Cavite and at the Philippine General Hospital last week is a sign of the mal-education of students influenced by anti-democratic forces."), ("Dahil dito, ang nasabing insidente ay nangangailangan ng value re-orientation tungo sa pagdidisiplina at pagbabalik ng kultura sa mga kabataang naiimpluwensiyahan ng ilang sektor.", "Because of this, the said incident needs a value re-orientation toward discipline and the return of culture among youth influenced by some sectors.")]
