_A9 = [("Anchor", "Samantala, ningas-kugon naman na pagpaparehistro ng mga botante binatikos naman ng COMELEC Cam Sur.", "Meanwhile, the ningas-kugon registration of voters was criticized by COMELEC Cam Sur."), ("Anchor", "Kunin natin ang detalye mula sa aming kasamang si Grace Refaarmasimando ng Radyo ng Bayan, Naga.", "Let us get the details from our colleague Grace Refaarmasimando of Radyo ng Bayan, Naga."), ("Grace", "Ayon sa COMELEC Cam Sur, ang akala daw nila ay tuluy-tuloy na ang makapal na turn-out ng mga kabataang nagpaparehistro tulad noong unang araw.", "According to COMELEC Cam Sur, they thought the thick turn-out of young people registering, like on the first day, would continue."), ("Grace", "Pero ngayon hindi na ikinatutuwa ng COMELEC Cam Sur ang mahina at matamlay na pagbibisita ng mga botante sa kanilang tanggapan upang magparehistro.", "But now COMELEC Cam Sur is no longer pleased with the weak and sluggish visits of voters to their office to register."), ("Grace", "Kaugnay nito, nananawagan ang COMELEC sa mga botante na samantalahin na ang maagang panahon na ito na makakuha sila ng biometrics at magpaparehistro upang magamit ang kanilang mahalagang boto at hindi na makipagsiksikan pa sa mga huling araw ng rehistro.", "In connection with this, the COMELEC calls on voters to take advantage of this early time to get their biometrics and register, so that they can use their important vote and no longer have to crowd in during the last days of registration."), ("Grace", "Sabi pa ng COMELEC minabuti na nga nilang magbukas ng tanggapan kahit Sabado’t linggo upang ma-accommodate lang ang lahat ng mga nagtatrabaho at day-off lamang kung weekend upang pati sila ay tiyaking makakapagparehistro.", "The COMELEC also said they decided to open the office even on Saturdays and Sundays to accommodate all those who work and have a day off only on weekends, so that they too are sure to be able to register.")]
